      "writtenOn": "2024-10-08T06:52:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I believe this also suffers from the same problem\n\nNot exactly as after each use the array is a subject of GC as it is no longer referenced whereas in the existing code whole array will be kept. Having `buffer` would be another improvement.\n\n\u003e I am wondering however if that could be simplified by just changing the input parameter from a Set\u003c\u003e to a List\u003c\u003e?\n\n_I guess_ that having `Set` eliminates duplicates (at least in the call to `parentGroupsOf`) so it would very much depend on how are groups set in sites...",
